{"id":"n39944-1-10","stage":5,"title":"내실 · 充实","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n39944-1-10-1","ko":"이번 미술관 특별 전시회에 같이 가자.","zh":"这次美术馆的特别展览，我们一起去吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미술관","meaning":"美术馆","explanation":"미술관：美术馆","readings":[{"term":"미술관","audio":"/audio/03c34f236b077be22f36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56220","senseId":"1","lemma":"미술관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"특별","meaning":"特别","explanation":"특별：特别","readings":[{"term":"특별","audio":"/audio/d1dda53fe376988b83dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49420","senseId":"1","lemma":"특별","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전시회에","meaning":"展示会","explanation":"전시회：展示会；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전시회","audio":"/audio/2238ab819aaac418f808.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31692","senseId":"1","lemma":"전시회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去，前往","explanation":"가다：去，前往；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"3","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"03c34f236b077be2","term":"미술관","zh":"美术馆","audio":"/audio/03c34f236b077be22f36.mp3","entryId":"56220","definition":"为展示美术作品、供人欣赏而建造的设施。","pronunciation":["미ː술관"]},{"id":"d1dda53fe37